{"title":"Career roadmap · Claims Analyst","role":"Claims Analyst","summary":"A Claims Analyst evaluates insurance claims, validates policy coverage, reviews documentation, analyses claim amounts, identifies inconsistencies or potential fraud, communicates with internal teams/customers, and helps insurers make accurate and compliant claim decisions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest career combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Actuarial/Insurance","Insurance Fundamentals","Claims Processing","Policy Interpretation","Data Analysis","Fraud Detection","Excel/SQL/Power BI","Regulatory Awareness","Internship"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Claims Analyst"},{"text":"Claim review and analysis"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Claims Associate"},{"text":"Claims processing"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Claims Executive"},{"text":"Documentation and settlement support"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Claims Operations Associate"},{"text":"Workflow and quality"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Insurance Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Insurance process analytics"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Senior Claims Analyst"},{"text":"Complex claims and quality"}],[{"text":"3–6 Years"},{"text":"Claims Specialist"},{"text":"Specialised claims"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Claims Quality Analyst"},{"text":"Accuracy, controls and audits"}],[{"text":"5–9 Years"},{"text":"Claims Manager"},{"text":"Team and claims operations"}],[{"text":"7–12 Years"},{"text":"Claims Operations Manager"},{"text":"Large-scale claims management"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Head of Claims / Claims Strategy"},{"text":"Claims governance and transformation"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A Claims Analyst is not the same as an Actuary. Actuarial careers focus heavily on risk modelling, pricing, reserving and actuarial examinations, while claims professionals focus on claim assessment, coverage, documentation, investigation, settlement and operations."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Com","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Insurance + Commerce Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business statistics"},{"text":"Business mathematics"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Banking and financial services"},{"text":"Insurance fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Life insurance"},{"text":"Health insurance"},{"text":"Motor insurance"},{"text":"Property insurance"},{"text":"Travel insurance"},{"text":"Liability insurance"},{"text":"Commercial insurance"},{"text":"Personal accident insurance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basic relationship:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Risk","Policy","Premium","Coverage","Claim","Assessment","Settlement"]},{"type":"h","text":"Important terminology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policyholder"},{"text":"Insured"},{"text":"Insurer"},{"text":"Premium"},{"text":"Sum insured"},{"text":"Deductible"},{"text":"Co-payment"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"Endorsement"},{"text":"Nominee"},{"text":"Claimant"},{"text":"Coverage period"},{"text":"Waiting period"},{"text":"Loss"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IF"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-1 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Claims Lifecycle Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Policy Issued","Incident","Claim Intimation","Documentation","Assessment","Decision","Settlement/Repudiation","Closure"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Claims Processing + Insurance Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Move from insurance theory into actual claims workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Claims lifecycle"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim notification"},{"text":"Claim registration"},{"text":"Policy verification"},{"text":"Coverage verification"},{"text":"Document collection"},{"text":"Claim assessment"},{"text":"Investigation, where required"},{"text":"Loss estimation"},{"text":"Approval/rejection decision"},{"text":"Settlement"},{"text":"Closure"},{"text":"Complaint/escalation handling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Policy interpretation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coverage"},{"text":"Exclusions"},{"text":"Deductibles"},{"text":"Limits"},{"text":"Waiting periods"},{"text":"Conditions"},{"text":"Endorsements"},{"text":"Policy validity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The analyst should learn to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Is this event covered under this policy, and if so, what amount is potentially payable under the policy terms?"},{"type":"h","text":"Claims documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on insurance type, documents may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim form"},{"text":"Policy details"},{"text":"Identity documents"},{"text":"Bills/invoices"},{"text":"Medical records"},{"text":"FIR/police documents where applicable"},{"text":"Repair estimates"},{"text":"Surveyor reports"},{"text":"Bank details"},{"text":"Supporting evidence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-2 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Automated Claims Validation Workbook"},{"type":"p","text":"Build checks for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Missing documents"},{"text":"Duplicate claims"},{"text":"Policy expiry"},{"text":"Amount exceeding coverage"},{"text":"Duplicate claimant information"},{"text":"Unusual claim frequency"},{"text":"Pending claims"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Claims Analytics + Fraud Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the key differentiator."},{"type":"h","text":"Claims analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim frequency"},{"text":"Claim severity"},{"text":"Average claim amount"},{"text":"Loss ratio"},{"text":"Settlement ratio"},{"text":"Claim turnaround time"},{"text":"Pending claims"},{"text":"Reopened claims"},{"text":"Claim ageing"},{"text":"Rejection rate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fraud awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand common red flags such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duplicate claims"},{"text":"Repeated claims"},{"text":"Suspicious timing"},{"text":"Inconsistent information"},{"text":"Unusual claim amounts"},{"text":"Identity anomalies"},{"text":"Provider anomalies"},{"text":"Document inconsistencies"},{"text":"Unusual claimant behaviour"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is not to automatically label a claimant as fraudulent. An anomaly should trigger appropriate investigation or review."},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"SELECT"},{"type":"p","text":"WHERE"},{"type":"p","text":"GROUP BY"},{"type":"p","text":"ORDER BY"},{"type":"p","text":"JOIN"},{"type":"p","text":"CASE"},{"type":"p","text":"Subqueries"},{"type":"p","text":"Window functions"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claims volume dashboard"},{"text":"Claims ageing dashboard"},{"text":"Settlement dashboard"},{"text":"Claims severity dashboard"},{"text":"Fraud-risk indicator dashboard"},{"text":"Branch/region performance dashboard"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Statistics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mean"},{"text":"Median"},{"text":"Variance"},{"text":"Standard deviation"},{"text":"Percentiles"},{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Correlation"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Regression basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year-3 project"},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Claims Analytics & Fraud-Risk Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Claim frequency","Claim severity","Claim patterns","Anomalies","Investigation priority"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Advanced Claims + Insurance Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on employability."},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced claims management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complex claim assessment"},{"text":"Claims reserving concepts"},{"text":"Claims leakage"},{"text":"Claims quality"},{"text":"Claims audit"},{"text":"Service-level agreements"},{"text":"Turnaround-time management"},{"text":"Escalation management"},{"text":"Customer complaints"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Claims reserving awareness"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reported claims"},{"text":"Paid claims"},{"text":"Outstanding claims"},{"text":"Incurred claims"},{"text":"Incurred but not reported claims (IBNR)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Claims Analyst does not automatically become an actuary or reserving specialist, but understanding these concepts makes the analyst much stronger."},{"type":"h","text":"Actuarial Connection"},{"type":"p","text":"Since the degree is Actuarial / Insurance, students should understand the connection:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Claims Data","Actuarial Analysis","Loss Experience","Pricing/Reserving","Insurance Decisions"]},{"type":"p","text":"Claims professionals generate and validate much of the underlying claims information used by actuarial and risk teams."},{"type":"h","text":"If the student wants to move toward actuarial work"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Financial mathematics"},{"text":"Actuarial mathematics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"R/Python"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Actuarial examination pathway"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-Year Project"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-Powered Insurance Claims Analytics & Decision Support System"},{"type":"h","text":"Module 1 — Claims Database"},{"type":"p","text":"Store:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy ID"},{"text":"Claim ID"},{"text":"Claim type"},{"text":"Claim date"},{"text":"Policy date"},{"text":"Claim amount"},{"text":"Approved amount"},{"text":"Settlement status"},{"text":"Processing time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Module 2 — Rule Engine"},{"type":"p","text":"Check:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy validity"},{"text":"Coverage"},{"text":"Claim amount"},{"text":"Missing documentation"},{"text":"Duplicate claim indicators"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Module 3 — Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Claim frequency"},{"text":"Average severity"},{"text":"Settlement rate"},{"text":"Claim ageing"},{"text":"Loss ratio"},{"text":"Processing time"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Module 4 — Fraud-Risk Detection"},{"type":"p","text":"Use analytics/ML to identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duplicate patterns"},{"text":"Unusual claim values"},{"text":"Frequency anomalies"},{"text":"Behavioural anomalies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Module 5 — Dashboard"},{"type":"h","text":"SQL → Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Module 6 — AI"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Document classification"},{"text":"Claim summarisation"},{"text":"Information extraction"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Claims prioritisation"},{"text":"Customer communication drafts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human review remains important for consequential claim decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"4-Year Honours / Advanced Variant"},{"type":"p","text":"An honours/research route can specialise in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Insurance Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Predictive modelling"},{"text":"Claim frequency modelling"},{"text":"Claim severity modelling"},{"text":"Risk segmentation"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Actuarial Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probabi